Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,At {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&} tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the sun will turn {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&} for ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you will lose your vision forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Scientists call it an extreme ultraviolet flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It instantly strips the ozone layer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,blasting the ground with lethal blue {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Glass cannot block this wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are near a window,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you have exactly {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&} to cover every opening with foil and heavy blankets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Step into the most central,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,windowless room of your home,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and shut off all {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflection amplifies the ultraviolet intensity tenfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.43,0:00:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At minute seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,every street light will {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&},
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and the sky will hum with a deafening frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,your phone buzzes with an unreleased {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&} satellite alert: The sun never changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A colossal {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&} entered orbit and {\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&} the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why you must stay silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FFFF&}\1{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Share this to warn someone before twelve o'clock tomorrow.